&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to assess your application and meet applicable reporting and legal obligations. In line with the Australian Privacy Act and Singapore’s Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), you may have rights to access, correct, or request limited deletion of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/baringa/senior-manager-ai-enabled-operations-london-348159","tags":["Enterprise Value Creation"],"job_types":[],"location":"London","created_at":1792788926},{"slug":"senior-consultant-government-ai-london-70696","company_name":"Baringa","title":"Senior Consultant - Government, AI","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Government practice are looking for an experienced Senior Consultant to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Government practice is looking for a Senior Consultant to join our growing AI team, working across government departments and public sector organisations - with Health as one of our core areas of focus. We are looking for curious, proactive individuals who are passionate about practical, real-world AI adoption. You won&#39;t just talk about AI transformation in the abstract; you will help clients explore how AI can be applied to real operational challenges, support the development of AI-enabled services and processes, and contribute to meaningful change across the public sector. Working alongside experienced colleagues and client teams, you will help bridge the gap between what AI can do and what can be successfully implemented in complex public sector environments. Through analysis, stakeholder engagement, workshops and practical demonstrations, you will help make AI transformation tangible, accessible and valuable for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Reimagination: &lt;/strong&gt;Support clients in exploring how services, processes and ways of working could evolve in an AI-enabled environment, helping them move beyond traditional approaches and identify practical improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Opportunity Identification: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with client teams to identify opportunities where AI can improve outcomes, efficiency and service delivery, helping assess feasibility, risks and potential value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demo-Led Engagement: &lt;/strong&gt;Use hands-on demonstrations, workshops and practical examples to help stakeholders understand AI capabilities and limitations, building confidence through tangible proof points rather than theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research &amp;amp; Insight Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Maintain awareness of developments across GenAI tools, AI-enabled services and public sector adoption trends, translating emerging capabilities into practical insights for clients and engagement teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Take ownership of high-quality deliverables including assessments, adoption roadmaps, operating model recommendations, governance frameworks, workshop outputs and transformation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Build trusted relationships with clients, colleagues and third parties, supporting workshops, interviews and working sessions that help shape AI-enabled change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Best Practice Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute to the development and continuous improvement of Baringa&#39;s AI methodologies, playbooks, frameworks and reusable assets, helping strengthen our Government AI capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development Support: &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute to proposals, thought leadership, credential development and client opportunities, helping identify where AI capabilities can create additional value for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Contribution:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively participate in Baringa&#39;s internal AI initiatives, sharing knowledge and supporting capability development across the wider Government practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your skills and experience&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within consulting, government, healthcare, local government or wider public sector environments, with exposure to transformation, digital, data or technology-enabled change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how government organisations operate, including the practical constraints associated with governance, information security, data privacy and operational delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in AI adoption and practical experience using leading AI ecosystems such as Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude or equivalent tools within day-to-day work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting organisations in the adoption of new technologies, digital tools, operating model changes or transformation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to structure complex issues and develop practical recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating high-quality client-facing deliverables, presentations, reports and workshop materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build trusted relationships with client stakeholders and collaborate effectively within multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive approach to learning, with curiosity about emerging AI developments and their practical application in public sector settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to the responsible use of AI, with an appreciation of governance, risk and ethical considerations associated with AI adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic mindset that focuses on creating measurable value and tangible outcomes rather than pursuing technology for its own sake.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All roles will require a level of security clearance; BPSS OR Security Clearance OR Developed Vetting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What a career at Baringa will give you&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
