&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Salary: £61,500 to £80,000&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Riverlane’s&amp;nbsp;mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&amp;nbsp;Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology.&amp;nbsp; It’s a complex problem that requires a range of skills,&amp;nbsp;talent&amp;nbsp;and passion.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;R&amp;amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and governments to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality.&amp;nbsp;We’re&amp;nbsp;making remarkable progress and growing fast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an exceptional &lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the positioning, messaging, and go-to-market strategy for &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.riverlane.com/deltaflow&quot;&gt;Deltaflow&lt;/a&gt;, our real-time quantum error correction (QEC) system. Deltaflow is a critical component in the quantum computing stack, enabling the ultra-fast data processing and decoding required to correct errors in quantum computers in real time with high accuracy and throughput.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique opportunity to join a world-leading deep-tech company at a pivotal stage of market development. You will sit at the intersection of engineering, product, customers, and commercial strategy, translating highly technical innovations into compelling value propositions for quantum computing companies, national laboratories and HPC centres.&amp;nbsp; You will help us craft the value proposition and marketing plan for each of our partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee Deltaflow’s product marketing strategy, positioning, messaging architecture and customer value proposition(s)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Segment the Deltaflow value proposition for different audiences, particularly quantum hardware companies, national labs and HPC Centres. They may require different capability bundles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop product briefs, presentations, website content, and sales collateral&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create effective collateral and campaigns including product website, video explainers, webinars and demos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market and competitor research analysis and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee our partner marketing programme for Deltaflow, covering both customers and technology partners. This will include joint demos, case studies, talks, usage data and testimonials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage one partner marketing manager, initially&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay abreast of important engineering, science and product developments in the industry, particularly as it relates to QEC, real time decoding, control and simulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a key member of a collaborative Marketing team of 6-8 people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a champion and voice of the customer within Riverlane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we need&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum 5+ years’ experience in deep tech product marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in articulating ‘deep tech’ with clear and compelling storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience taking complex technical products from development through market adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building positioning, messaging, and go-to-market strategies for emerging technology categories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise technology buyers and technical decision-making processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine curiosity about quantum computing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, cross-functional team player, in line with our company values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a fast-moving, rapidly evolving, self-empowering culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Even better if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have product marketing experience in quantum computing, semi-conductors, software or computing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can you expect from us&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A comprehensive benefits package that includes&amp;nbsp;an annual bonus plan,&amp;nbsp;private medical insurance, life insurance, and a&amp;nbsp;contributory pension scheme&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity, so that our team can share in the long-term success of Riverlane&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 days annual leave,&amp;nbsp;plus bank holidays and enhanced family leave&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse work environment that brings together experts in many fields (including software and hardware development, quantum information theory,&amp;nbsp;physics&amp;nbsp;and maths) and over 20 different nationalities&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A learning environment that encourages individual, team and company growth and&amp;nbsp;development, including a regular programme of learning events and training and conference budgets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter by clicking &#39;Apply Now&#39;. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for the job and what skills and experience you can bring to the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We review CVs as we receive them and interview as soon as we have applications that look like a good match. We do not use closing dates. So, please apply as soon as possible to avoid missing out on this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have any queries, please contact &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone is welcome at Riverlane. We are an equal opportunities employer and encourage applications from eligible and suitably qualified candidates regardless of age, disability, ethnicity, gender, gender reassignment, religion or belief, sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, or pregnancy and maternity/paternity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Women and other underrepresented groups may be less likely to apply for a role unless they meet all or nearly all of the requirements.&amp;nbsp; If this applies to you, we still encourage you to apply - you may be a great fit, even if you don’t meet every single qualification. We’d love to hear from you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6&quot; class=&quot;x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/riverlane/senior-product-marketing-manager-hardware-cambridge-311578","tags":["Marketing"],"job_types":[],"location":"Cambridge","created_at":1792778120},{"slug":"senior-returns-manager-eu-london-236436","company_name":"Quince","title":"Senior Returns Manager, EU","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Returns Manager to own end-to-end reverse logistics performance across our UK and EU operations. From forecasting incoming volume through grading, refunds, fraud prevention, and resale, you&#39;ll build a returns operation that&#39;s fast, accurate, and cost-efficient — while turning returned inventory back into recovered value. This is a hands-on role for someone who can dig into root causes, manage partners and carriers, and build the reporting to prove it&#39;s working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Returns Forecasting &amp;amp; Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain returns volume forecasting models across UK and EU markets, factoring in seasonality, backlog, promotions, and category-level return patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate forecasts into staffing, processing capacity, and warehouse space plans for returns operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor returns rate trends and flag volume shifts to inventory, finance, and merchandising teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Refunds&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee timely, accurate refund processing in line with UK and EU consumer rights regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit warehouse/QRC staff on grading standards and quality checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customer service and finance to resolve refund discrepancies and disputes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track refund turnaround time against SLA and resolve bottlenecks in the refund workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Detection &amp;amp; Prevention&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and refine fraud detection processes for returns abuse (wardrobing, serial returners, empty-box claims, item-not-as-described fraud)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with risk and customer service teams to develop fraud rules/flags and investigate high-risk cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance fraud prevention with customer experience, avoiding over-blocking of legitimate returns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Returns Root Cause &amp;amp; Logistics Feedback&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and categorize return reasons, with particular focus on logistics-driven returns (damaged in transit, wrong item shipped, late or failed delivery, packaging failure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with warehouse, supply chain, and carrier teams to reduce logistics-driven returns through root cause analysis and corrective action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present return reason trends to leadership to inform packaging, product, and logistics improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Returns Resale &amp;amp; Recommerce&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage resale/recommerce channels for graded inventory (open-box, refurbished, clearance, secondary market and liquidation partners)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximize recovery value on returned inventory while minimizing time-to-resale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage relationships with resale/liquidation partners and evaluate new recommerce channels across UK and EU markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reverse Logistics &amp;amp; Carrier Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate rates and service levels with carriers for return shipments across UK and EU markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage carrier performance for return pickups, label generation, and inbound transit times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and roll out returns-specific shipping options (paperless returns, drop-off points, pickup services) to reduce cost and improve the customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SLA &amp;amp; Performance Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and manage SLAs across the returns lifecycle — receipt to grading, grading to disposition, refund turnaround, and time-to-resale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor 3PL and warehouse partner performance against returns SLAs; escalate and resolve issues as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reporting and dashboards to track returns KPIs and turn data into actionable recommendations for leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customer service, supply chain, finance, and merchandising to align returns operations with broader business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure returns operations comply with UK and EU consumer protection, distance selling, and VAT/duty rules (including treatment of re-imported goods and refund-related VAT adjustments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on evolving returns-related regulation across UK and EU markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–8+ years managing returns or reverse logistics operations in a high-volume ecommerce or retail environment, ideally across UK and EU markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building returns forecasting and capacity planning models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of UK and EU consumer rights, refund, and distance-selling regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or managing returns fraud detection and prevention programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record reducing logistics-driven returns through root cause analysis and cross-functional fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing return resale, refurbishment, or liquidation channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carrier negotiation experience for reverse logistics/return shipping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SLA and KPI management skills, with reporting experience (Excel, SQL, or BI tools)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with WMS/OMS returns modules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in DTC, fashion/apparel, or other high-return-rate ecommerce categories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with recommerce or liquidation platforms and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating across multiple EU countries and languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in fraud/risk analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing reverse logistics SLAs with UK/EU carriers (e.g., Royal Mail, Evri, DPD, DHL, GLS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
