unication, structured evaluations, and a positive candidate experience.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage offer processes, including compensation coordination, offer approvals, and preparation of employment contracts in partnership with HR and leadership.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track recruiting metrics, pipeline health, time-to-fill, and other key indicators to identify opportunities to improve hiring effectiveness.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain accurate applicant tracking system records and recruiting documentation.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support the development of consistent recruiting practices across locations while accounting for local market expectations.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><u>HR Operations</u></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate preboarding and onboarding activities, including background checks, system entry, equipment, relocation coordination, and orientation.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with hiring managers and cross-functional teams to ensure new employees have a smooth, engaging start.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support new-hire check-ins and identify opportunities to improve the onboarding experience.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support employee lifecycle processes, including new hires, employment changes, internal transfers, and departures.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assist with HR reporting, audits, and other operational projects as needed.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate with external payroll providers, benefits partner