yle="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your impact</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As Senior Product Manager, you'll own a significant part of our Business Banking product, one of the newest and most ambitious areas we're building at Mollie.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a build from scratch opportunity. Mollie's position here is rare: we're a payment service provider with a large, established customer base that is now building a full banking proposition on top of it. That means you get the ambition and pace of building something new, combined with the resources, customers, and best practices of a scaled business. You'll work alongside experienced, passionate product leaders who've done this before.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll lead a cross-functional team across design, product, and data analytics. There are no direct reports in this role, but you'll own the team's day to day performance and make sure things ship on time.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll ship</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Net-new propositions, not incremental iteration. You're building experiences that don't exist yet.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Customer-facing product and APIs across the Mollie app (web and native mobile) for business banking customers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A banking proposition layered on Mollie's existing payments infrastructure, reaching customers who are already active and engaged.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll bring</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience leading a cross-functional product team in an everyday, hands-on capacity</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort with the full product lifecycle, including early-stage building and scaling</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to